  "ingredients": [
    "1/3 cup erythritol (for caramel)",
    "1/8 cup water",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1/4 cup erythritol (for custard)",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "2 large egg",
    "2 large egg yolk"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a deep pan, heat up the sweetener listed for the caramel until it is completely melted and clear. Be sure to stir frequently.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully add in the water and butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir occasionally, until the sauce has become a golden brown. Use caution not to burn.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour equally into the bottom of each ramekin, which should cover the bottom nicely. Set aside and let them cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. In a bowl, mix together the heavy whipping cream, the sweetener listed for custard, and the vanilla.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, whisk together the whole eggs. Add in the yolks, whisking once more.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly stir your eggs into the cream mix until blended.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the custard into each ramekin, on top of the caramel.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the ramekins into a casserole dish and fill it over half way with hot water. Again, be careful no water gets inside the ramekins.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 30 minutes. Take the casserole dish out of the oven, but leave the ramekins in the hot water for another 10 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using tongs, take out the ramekins and let them sit for at least 4 hours, or overnight, in the fridge. When ready to eat, take a knife and slowly run it along the inside edge of the custard to release it from the ramekin.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the ramekin upside down and slowly jiggle the custard onto the plate. You will have a beautiful golden sauce that is now on the top!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-flan/#wprm-recipe-52595-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/keto-flan-16.jpg"
    }
  ],
